00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:44,399
There can be only one.

2
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:22,799
Highlander is a adventure, action, fantasy film directed by Russell Mulcahy.

3
00:13:55,199 --> 00:14:01,199
He fought his first battle on the Scottish Highlands in 1536.

4
00:18:33,599 --> 00:18:39,599
He will fight his greatest battle on the streets of New York City in 1986.

5
